    "description": "Lightweight standalone design spec for AI coding agents: codebase scan → bounded clarify pass (3–5 questions, not a grill) → reviewed design doc written to docs/plans/ → independent scored review → stop. No task board, no build. Use when you want a spec to discuss, hand off, or review before committing to implementation. Chains into absolute-work when ready to build. Triggers on \"absolute spec\", \"write a spec\", \"spec out this feature\", \"draft a design doc\", \"I want a spec to hand off / review, don't build it yet\".\n",
